 "name_en": "Scheduling Agreement for Consignment Procurement (2NY)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Scheduling Agreement for Consignment Procurement (2NY)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The use of scheduling agreements can shorten processing times and reduce paperwork. One delivery schedule can replace many discrete purchase orders or contract release orders.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Delivery of the total quantity of materials specified in a scheduling agreement item is spread over a certain period in a delivery schedule, consisting of lines indicating the individual quantities with their corresponding planned delivery dates.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Your suppliers require shorter lead times. Smaller deliveries are required, which can be spaced out over a longer period. Delivery scheduling enables suppliers to plan and allocate their resources more efficiently.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In consignment processing, the supplier provides materials and delivers these to a consignment store.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The supplier remains the legal owner of the materials until these are withdrawn from the consignment stores.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Once withdrawn, the supplier requires payment.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase requisition – consignment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Convert purchase requisitions to scheduling agreement – consignment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create scheduling agreement – consignment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve scheduling agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain delivery schedule</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print scheduling agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt transferring posting from vendor-consigned stock to own stock</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Invoice receipt from consignment withdrawal</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce effort for discrete purchase order creation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce the cost for own stock</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>寄售采购的计划协议 (2NY)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用计划协议可以缩短处理时间并减少文书工作。一个交货计划可以替换许多离散采购订单或合同审批订单。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">计划协议项目中指定的物料总数量交货分布在交货计划的特定期间内，包括指示各个数量及其相应计划交货日期的行。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您的供应商需要更短的提前期。需要较小的交货，可以在更长时间内进行间距。交货计划使供应商能够更有效地计划和分配资源。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在寄售处理中，供应商提供物料并将其交付到寄售门店。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在从寄售库存中提取物料之前，供应商始终是物料的法定所有者。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">撤销后，供应商需要付款。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建采购申请 - 寄售</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将采购申请转换为计划协议 - 寄售</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建计划协议 - 寄售</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批计划协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护交货计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印计划协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将收货传输过账从供应商寄售库存过账到自有库存</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从寄售领料接收发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa7adff9ffd8e4389857540b08029dbb9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">减少离散采购订单创建的工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">降低自有库存的成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
